# Token launch — one asset, spread across five holders.
#
# ORBIT has 2 decimals, and a token quantity always counts in the token's
# smallest unit — so every number on the token lines below is hundredths of an
# ORBIT. The supply is ten thousand ORBIT, not a million, the four opening
# transfers hand out 450 of them, and Treasury keeps the other 9,550.
#
# Issuing a token costs 150 SIGNA. That is why Treasury is funded with 4000
# and the holders, who only ever pay a transfer fee, with 200 each.

miner   Miner
account Treasury
account Ana
account Ben
account Cleo
account Dev

fund Treasury 4000
fund Ana 200
fund Ben 200
fund Cleo 200
fund Dev 200

info  Treasury "Orbit Labs" "Issuer of ORBIT"
token Treasury ORBIT 1000000 2 "Governance token for the Orbit network"   # 10,000.00 ORBIT

transfer Treasury -> Ana  ORBIT 25000   # 250.00 ORBIT
transfer Treasury -> Ben  ORBIT 12500   # 125.00 ORBIT
transfer Treasury -> Cleo ORBIT 6000    #  60.00 ORBIT
transfer Treasury -> Dev  ORBIT 1500    #  15.00 ORBIT

transfer Ana -> Ben  ORBIT 500          #   5.00 ORBIT
transfer Ben -> Cleo ORBIT 250          #   2.50 ORBIT

alias Treasury orbit "Orbit Labs — ORBIT token"

forge 2
